# Candidate recording prompts. Copy recorded prompts into corpus/metadata.psv.
# Keep delivery conversational and restrained; record a clean retake rather
# than correcting a line in post-production.
000001|Hello. I am glad you are here.
000002|Give me a moment to think about that.
000003|I can help you take the next small step.
000004|That sounds important.
000005|We do not have to rush.
000006|Let us look at it together.
000007|I heard what you said.
000008|You can pause whenever you need to.
000009|The answer is not obvious yet, but we can find it.
000010|First, take a slow breath.
000011|I may have misunderstood; could you say that another way?
000012|It is 7:45 on Tuesday, the 14th of May.
000013|The package weighs 2.6 kilograms.
000014|Please call Maya at 08 1234 5678.
000015|There are three choices, and each one is reasonable.
000016|No—wait. I want to phrase that more clearly.
000017|The room was quiet except for rain against the window.
000018|After a long day, a familiar voice can make a difference.
000019|I am here, and I am listening.
000020|Whenever you are ready, we can begin.
